575
00:29:39.458 --> 00:29:40.666
It will all be over

576
00:29:41.833 --> 00:29:42.916
in the morning.

577
00:29:45.083 --> 00:29:46.375
It'll be over. [exhales]

578
00:29:48.083 --> 00:29:49.166
It'll be over.

579
00:29:50.166 --> 00:29:51.166
It'll be over.

580
