615
00:31:30.833 --> 00:31:32.250
Hey, bastard! Eat that, damn it!

616
00:31:32.333 --> 00:31:34.708
Baby, please, I'm begging you
to turn that thing down.

617
00:31:34.791 --> 00:31:36.875
Have some bread. Handan, you, too.

618
