Handan!

662
00:34:19.750 --> 00:34:20.791
Handan.

663
00:34:20.875 --> 00:34:22.541
[sighs]

664
00:34:24.541 --> 00:34:26.083
- Handan
- What? What? What?

665
00:34:26.166 --> 00:34:29.083
Handan, Handan, Handan, Handan, huh?
Fuck you and your Handan!

666
00:34:29.666 --> 00:34:31.041
