I am the only Dilara!

680
00:35:04.916 --> 00:35:07.750
Dilara Başaran. Okay?
I'm an actress, you got me?

681
00:35:07.833 --> 00:35:09.958
Take a good look at my face.
Take a good look!

682
00:35:10.750 --> 00:35:13.250
