687
00:35:19.291 --> 00:35:21.000
Who doesn't anyone recognize me?

688
00:35:21.083 --> 00:35:23.291
Why don't you recognize me, dammit?

689
00:35:23.791 --> 00:35:26.291
I am Dilara Başaran!
Who doesn't anyone recognize me?

690
00:35:26.375 --> 00:35:28.458
Oh, God, please help me
