697
00:35:44.916 --> 00:35:46.708
Thank you, dear God.

698
00:35:47.500 --> 00:35:49.208
Thank God, it's over.

699
00:35:49.750 --> 00:35:50.875
It's over. [inhales]

700
00:35:50.958 --> 00:35:52.250
